`@tailrec` only works when the recursive call is in tail position.
Common failure cases:

```scala
// NOT tail-recursive: work happens after recursion returns

def sum(xs: List[Int]): Int = xs match {
  case Nil => 0
  case head :: tail => head + sum(tail)
}
